{"diagnosis": "Fetch TB reports TRAP: no progress max_addr=0x00000000 with tohost FAIL 0xdead at CYCLES=2009 vs expected advancing fetches. Default assignment do_waitirq <= 1 at picorv32.v:1450 forces permanent wait-for-interrupt stall so fetch PC never advances. Restoring the default to 0, consistent with decoder_trigger defaults at picorv32.v:1446-1449 and trace_valid at picorv32.v:1452, fixes the stall.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1448,8 +1448,8 @@
 		decoder_pseudo_trigger <= 0;
 		decoder_pseudo_trigger_q <= decoder_pseudo_trigger;
-		do_waitirq <= 1;
+		do_waitirq <= 0;

 		trace_valid <= 0;

 		if (!ENABLE_TRACE)
 			trace_data <= 'bx;
", "expected": "tohost PASS with no TRAP: no progress, max_addr advancing beyond 0x00000000"}

